      "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 23 2017 11:25:15 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<h4><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Purchase order terms and conditions</span></h4>\n<h4><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">The “PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Global”, below, are applicable to all Purchase Orders issued by Stryker Corporation and its affiliates. If a jurisdiction specific version is published below, the jurisdiction specific version shall apply to purchases in that jurisdiction. If translations are provided for a jurisdiction below, any conflicts between the English language version and translated language version for that jurisdiction will be resolved in favor of the English language version.</span></span><br>\n</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Global%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Global Terms</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Netherlands%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Netherlands (English)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/Netherlands%20PO%20TsCs%20(Dutch%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Netherlands (Dutch)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Germany%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Germany (English)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/Germany%20PO%20TsCs%20(German%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Germany (German)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Ireland%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Ireland</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Switzerland%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Switzerland (English)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/Switzerland%20PO%20TsCs%20(German%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Switzerland (German)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Turkey%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Turkey (English)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/Turkey%20PO%20TsCs%20(Turkish%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Turkey (Turkish)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/United%20Kingdom%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker UK</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/France%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker France (English)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/France%20PO%20TsCs%20(French%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker France (French)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/Australia%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker Australia&nbsp;<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/China%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker China (English)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/translated/China%20PO%20TsCs%20(Chinese%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker China (Chinese)<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/po-terms/english/India%20PO%20TsCs%20(English%20Version).pdf\">PO Terms and Conditions Stryker India<br>\n </a><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/about/corporate-responsiblity/pdfs/170050.pdf\">Stryker's Supplier Code of Conduct</a></p>\n",
